    "walCompression defines the compression of the write-ahead log (WAL) using Snappy.\n\nWAL compression is enabled by default for Prometheus \u003e= 2.20.0\n\nRequires Prometheus v2.11.0 and above."
    web: PrometheusSpecWeb | None = None
    "web defines the configuration of the Prometheus web server."


